  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RtF - APIL Burkina Faso</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For RtF, APIL works in communes of Zitenga and Korsimoro in the Nakamb&#xE9; watershed were they already have long lasting relations. It is a context with a complex and multidimensional crisis; effects of climate change, drought, deterioration of natural resources, political instability and human crises caused by terrorists causing hosting of displaced persons. RtF allows APIL to continue the participatory community planning process which was already started and to carry out localy-led activities aimed at both ensuring food security, strengthening adaptation to climate change, to restore ecosystems for the benefit of vulnerable segments of displaced populations and those in areas hosting displaced people.</narrative>
  </description>
